1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:01,523
He never fired a shot.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,883
What he supplied was rarer: a cover story.

3
00:00:05,721 --> 00:00:08,065
It began with two boys at a military

4
00:00:08,078 --> 00:00:09,315
school in Punjab.

5
00:00:10,151 --> 00:00:12,417
One ran an immigration business.

6
00:00:12,807 --> 00:00:15,346
The other used its Mumbai office to scout

7
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:15,984
targets.

8
00:00:16,774 --> 00:00:17,868
An American jury:

9
00:00:18,493 --> 00:00:20,159
not guilty of Mumbai.

10
00:00:20,576 --> 00:00:23,258
Guilty of supporting the group behind it.

11
00:00:24,073 --> 00:00:24,998
Same events.

12
00:00:25,388 --> 00:00:26,443
Different crimes.

13
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,800
And that gap brought him to Delhi.

14
00:00:29,607 --> 00:00:30,479
The Front Man.

15
00:00:30,883 --> 00:00:32,758
Now on The Sisodia Files.

